{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0173_1000_p", "source_sha256": "62d47e0fdbb4d2a9b535a82acb0ec089a9bd647500bc69a8e9496471a01d376f", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影のため、紬と\n中華街にやってきた。そろそろ着替え終わるかな？）", "zh": "（为了拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》，和紬\n一起来到了中华街。差不多该换好衣服了吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0173_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "51028d29e2f230c63bd108268d800fde64334998c74e337488f4b6ae714b2bab", "ja": "お待たせいたしました。{$P$}、\n今日の撮影はまかせてください。", "zh": "让您久等了。{$P$}，今天的拍摄就交给我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0173_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6860ec85b09c558914ccd2073ae78289961a3206dcdf6e7a26ab670700511cc9", "ja": "おっ、頼もしい言葉だな。\n紬、そんなに自信あるのか？", "zh": "哦，这话听起来真让人放心。  \n紬，你就这么有自信吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0173_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "250d7562cee64ea21912fcd78c2b938e8f1be4b493cd7a4979326e67c2005807", "ja": "ええ。あなたは、私が知らない街で途方に暮れると\n思っていたかもしれませんが、そうはなりません。", "zh": "是的。您或许以为我会在陌生的城市里不知所措，但我不会那样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0173_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d5960f2668ccda1ffbf17e4eb744f464262a4a7db0fd9af774fcd86751a20694", "ja": "いや、別に思っていなかったけど……。", "zh": "不，我倒没这么想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0173_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "220964d1161f46409b7625bf63f2feede21876711131de702ed0f3945aa251ad", "ja": "事前にガイドブックを見て、中華街の名店を調べたり、\n周辺の地図を読み込んだりしてまいりました。", "zh": "我提前看过导游手册，查了中华街的名店，还把周边的地图都熟记于心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0173_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c48bd2530ab4682caf9aeb0db01df22beceee82624710cd72bbdd86545d333b3", "ja": "これで万が一にも、道に迷うことはありません。\nいざとなれば、道案内もできます。", "zh": "这样一来，就算发生万一，也不会迷路了。\n真到了需要的时候，我还可以帮忙带路。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0173_1007_p", "source_sha256": "efe6007aec70116693a971c9447026bab7f17e3f258f6e59f81c963a8247e14e", "ja": "なるほど。中華街のこと、しっかり予習してきて\nくれてたんだな。そんなに撮影、楽しみだったのか？", "zh": "原来如此。你提前认真做了关于中华街的功课啊。就这么期待拍摄吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0173_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "91e5cc01dd6e08c198333aab28dd1cbe7c7dc1a344d52d82441692d717cc2fb4", "ja": "は……？　何をおっしゃっているのですか。", "zh": "哈……？您在说什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0173_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "32c7a01f420ec5e2297603e11e367cf3437804996b4c49dbf18c4f705f78ebd5", "ja": "あなたが、この中華風のお衣装を選んだのでしょう？\n私は、格好に見合った努力をしただけです。", "zh": "是您选了这身中式服装吧？  \n我只是为配得上这身打扮而努力罢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0173_1010_p", "source_sha256": "238d0e0570a34584a786c544f9ed770d2286fb328088c2e49ef1e131a5c5c14b", "ja": "うん、紬の熱意や努力はわかった……ただ、撮影中に\n道を案内してもらうことは、ないとは思うんだが……。", "zh": "嗯，我明白了紬的热情和努力……只是，我觉得拍摄过程中应该不会让人带路……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0173_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a378547dc50baca2c906d47f063c2715c1a590ceb92e8a0966a0903880295587", "ja": "え……え？\nつまり……私の努力は、無意味だった、と……？", "zh": "诶……诶？\n也就是说……我的努力，都是白费了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0173_1012_p", "source_sha256": "3514d126166efecbc18af9ecce2a9f28048159ebf3839fe90bab08f9d3971d10", "ja": "あっ……いや、そうじゃないな！\n真剣に考えてくれてありがたいよ、うん！", "zh": "啊……不，不是那样！\n谢谢你愿意认真替我考虑，嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0173_1013_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a1217e0b634b9acf5f51b2deaf1166c2c68071e21bcc826e8b4b25f52985ef3a", "ja": "……。\nと、とにかく……頑張ります。", "zh": "……。\n总、总之……我会努力的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0173_1014_p", "source_sha256": "34d11678504b9b7d55057f1b9b160d748929bd57409f423fe6d2faf3eb535f62", "ja": "ああ、頑張ってくれ。紬の熱意はきっと、\nカメラを通して、ファンにも伝わると思うぞ！", "zh": "啊，加油吧。我想紬的热情一定会通过镜头传达给粉丝的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0173_1015_camman", "source_sha256": "eb27e272cf71841a32b6f258905dcb1dde04bcd60f55edcadef8d453bf2e40ba", "ja": "お疲れ様です、白石さん！　素晴らしい撮影に\nなりましたね！　中華な雰囲気、ばっちりでした！", "zh": "辛苦了，白石小姐！这次拍摄非常棒！中华风情，恰到好处！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0173_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "bbeb491a9372aa063e1ede40512ed909d29ae54c2d1d70497a2b20ef8bddc10f", "ja": "はい。ありがとうございます。\n自分でも満足のいく撮影ができ、ほっとしました。", "zh": "是的。谢谢您。\n这次拍摄达到了自己满意的效果，我也松了口气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0173_1017_camman", "source_sha256": "ea44d34cf9ab0a47b46ef08d015bda96d64739ea419fbb93b0ceabd0cffd7294", "ja": "良かった。あ、そうだ。これから\nどこか近場で打ち上げをやりたいんですが……。", "zh": "太好了。啊，对了。接下来想在附近找个地方办庆功宴……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0173_1018_p", "source_sha256": "a7338f363b7aff0e1b5a1a1f66ea2697b9cc1dd1e70f48c189a7e012aef5814f", "ja": "打ち上げ……ああ！　それなら、白石がいい店を\n知っていると思いますよ。だよな、紬？", "zh": "庆功宴……啊！那样的话，我想白石应该知道一家不错的店。对吧，紬？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0173_1019_051tmg", "source_sha256": "17a2b93a528c87c2055cd8fb454e98d9ac503b4ca72ebb87651d160bc4c804ed", "ja": "あっ……！\nは、はい！　ご案内いたします！", "zh": "啊……！\n是、是的！我来为您带路！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0173_1020_p", "source_sha256": "5db1504f1d546a310427d2efe084c5ca0e3b14fd2140ae7cb3e044e30bc7a90d", "ja": "（この後、紬の紹介してくれた店で舌鼓を打った。\nアイドル活動に無駄な事なんて、ひとつもないな）", "zh": "（之后，在紬介绍的店里美美地吃了一顿。\n偶像活动没有任何一件事是多余的啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
